WEBVTT

00:00:01.170 --> 00:00:05.780
Academia's invasion caused the Maiami 
Championship to be canceled.

00:00:07.560 --> 00:00:09.040
Some of the spectators

00:00:09.040 --> 00:00:12.000
couldn't believe the ridiculous story of 
invaders from another dimension.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:15.330
They were shocked by the sight of 
our battle against Academia.

00:00:15.890 --> 00:00:17.800
And they praised us as heroes.

00:00:18.470 --> 00:00:21.700
But I couldn't protect Yuzu.

00:00:22.030 --> 00:00:25.760
I'll become stronger than before, 
beat all our enemies,

00:00:25.760 --> 00:00:27.930
and bring back Yuzu, no matter what!

00:00:31.380 --> 00:00:34.870
But then, Mom suddenly challenged me to a duel.

00:00:35.540 --> 00:00:37.790
Settling scores, getting payback...

00:00:37.790 --> 00:00:40.020
Don't use duels for such things!

00:00:40.440 --> 00:00:42.560
Then, what should I do?

00:00:42.560 --> 00:00:44.360
Just abandon my teammate?

00:00:45.320 --> 00:00:47.060
If you really must duel...

00:00:47.700 --> 00:00:49.760
Let's have fun with it!

00:00:50.450 --> 00:00:52.960
I activate Smile World!

00:01:01.760 --> 00:01:05.370
The man who appeared was Yusyo Sakaki.

00:01:05.830 --> 00:01:08.360
That's right, your father.

00:01:09.570 --> 00:01:15.290
Implementing mass into Solid Vision 
has created Action Duels.

00:01:15.290 --> 00:01:20.040
In duels where the field, monsters 
and duelists become one,

00:01:20.040 --> 00:01:23.060
the people are caught in a frenzy of excitement!

00:02:57.160 --> 00:03:01.930
A Duel of Smiles 
"Smile World"

00:03:03.380 --> 00:03:07.070
Without warning, he appeared 
in the middle of our duel,

00:03:07.670 --> 00:03:10.310
saving my teammate at once.

00:03:12.100 --> 00:03:15.030
The way he settled our fight, without any injuries,

00:03:15.640 --> 00:03:17.580
left me dumbstruck.

00:03:18.310 --> 00:03:20.440
He stole my heart away, too.

00:03:21.040 --> 00:03:22.920
She wants to talk up her man?

00:03:23.430 --> 00:03:26.020
Is that the reason she challenged him to a duel?

00:03:30.680 --> 00:03:33.730
Really, I had no idea what kind 
of man I was dealing with...

00:03:33.730 --> 00:03:36.540
I'd used duels only as a means to settle scores.

00:03:36.540 --> 00:03:41.560
And here he was, telling me to use 
them to bring joy to people.

00:03:42.240 --> 00:03:44.440
Duels make people happy.

00:03:44.440 --> 00:03:46.170
They make them smile.

00:03:46.480 --> 00:03:49.410
Duels are bridges that bring people together!

00:03:49.770 --> 00:03:51.880
That is what I believe!

00:03:56.050 --> 00:03:58.380
Amazing! I've never seen anything like it!

00:04:02.500 --> 00:04:06.280
After I met him, I gave up the gang,

00:04:06.280 --> 00:04:10.260
and I pledged to live with Yusyo Sakaki!

00:04:11.600 --> 00:04:14.200
It's just reminiscence! What's with her?

00:04:14.630 --> 00:04:17.440
Around that time, the pro duel world

00:04:17.440 --> 00:04:22.210
had only just started incorporating 
the Real Solid Vision System

00:04:22.210 --> 00:04:23.640
developed by the Leo Corporation.

00:04:24.130 --> 00:04:27.110
In other words, it was the dawn 
of the Action Duels.

00:04:28.190 --> 00:04:32.400
But at the time, rather than action, 
they were more like power brawls,

00:04:32.400 --> 00:04:35.140
in which you sent your strongest 
monsters at each other.

00:04:35.760 --> 00:04:39.960
I believe Shuzo has already taught you about that.

00:04:40.240 --> 00:04:41.460
Yeah.

00:04:41.460 --> 00:04:45.980
Yusyo Sakaki brought thrills 
and speed to Action Duels.

00:04:46.770 --> 00:04:48.700
A door to a new future

00:04:48.700 --> 00:04:51.850
won't open until someone has 
the courage to push it open!

00:04:51.850 --> 00:04:56.410
Yuya, you opened a new door called "Pendulum"!

00:04:56.410 --> 00:04:59.520
Just as Dad helped Action Duels to thrive,

00:04:59.520 --> 00:05:03.750
he said that I should become the 
example for everyone to follow,

00:05:03.750 --> 00:05:06.440
as the first to open Pendulum's door.

00:05:07.200 --> 00:05:09.960
When we dueled, that's what he told me.

00:05:09.960 --> 00:05:11.660
He spurred me on.

00:05:14.470 --> 00:05:17.600
Right? And have you been doing that?

00:05:19.200 --> 00:05:21.800
I'm asking if you've been a good example.

00:05:22.050 --> 00:05:23.340
A good example?

00:05:24.530 --> 00:05:26.540
I... I...

00:05:26.800 --> 00:05:27.770
You?

00:05:28.180 --> 00:05:31.980
I don't know if I've been a good example, but...

00:05:32.240 --> 00:05:33.180
But?

00:05:33.720 --> 00:05:36.140
I'm doing the best I can!

00:05:36.140 --> 00:05:39.210
I saw Yuzu trying hard to get stronger,

00:05:39.210 --> 00:05:42.150
and I sought what lay beyond Pendulum!

00:05:42.400 --> 00:05:43.360
And?

00:05:43.360 --> 00:05:47.590
I found it! I found Pendulum Fusion 
and Pendulum Xyz!

00:05:47.590 --> 00:05:48.590
And?

00:05:49.570 --> 00:05:52.490
Learning what lay beyond Pendulum 
and becoming stronger...

00:05:52.490 --> 00:05:54.750
I'm asking you, what do they matter?

00:05:54.750 --> 00:05:57.420
Isn't it obvious? To save Yuzu!

00:05:58.850 --> 00:05:59.930
Yuya...

00:06:00.270 --> 00:06:03.480
But as I am, I'm not good enough!

00:06:03.480 --> 00:06:06.750
I need to... I need to become stronger!

00:06:07.250 --> 00:06:10.450
And I will... I will...

00:06:10.820 --> 00:06:12.150
I will save Yuzu!

00:06:12.660 --> 00:06:13.890
Darling...

00:06:14.200 --> 00:06:17.520
Really, you are just like me.

00:06:18.500 --> 00:06:20.600
So straightforward and uncompromising.

00:06:20.600 --> 00:06:23.130
So goal-oriented, you can't see anything else.

00:06:23.670 --> 00:06:26.000
You'd happily crush the opposing team

00:06:26.000 --> 00:06:29.240
if it meant saving your captured friend.

00:06:29.240 --> 00:06:33.370
You're just like Shooting Star Yoko, 
boss of that ladies gang.

00:06:33.660 --> 00:06:37.800
But you're Yusyo Sakaki's son, too.

00:06:37.800 --> 00:06:41.030
I respect your desire to save Yuzu.

00:06:41.030 --> 00:06:43.260
And you definitely should.

00:06:43.900 --> 00:06:45.310
After all,

00:06:45.310 --> 00:06:50.040
Yuzu is Shuzo's precious, irreplaceable treasure!

00:06:55.160 --> 00:06:57.600
Shuzo Sakaki Retirement Ceremony

00:06:57.600 --> 00:06:59.560
Happy Opening Day!

00:07:09.770 --> 00:07:10.960
Yuzu!

00:07:10.960 --> 00:07:12.720
Yuzu!

00:07:13.780 --> 00:07:14.680
Why?

00:07:17.890 --> 00:07:21.350
We want Yuzu to be safe, just like you do.

00:07:22.020 --> 00:07:24.120
Even if you want to save Yuzu,

00:07:24.120 --> 00:07:26.860
you have to think of everyone, not only yourself.

00:07:27.730 --> 00:07:31.030
Just like Dad... Enemy and ally alike.

00:07:31.030 --> 00:07:33.630
That's right. Make Sora smile, too!

00:07:34.970 --> 00:07:39.920
Don't worry. If you still think of Sora 
as a friend, I know you'll do it.

00:07:39.920 --> 00:07:42.610
And not just Sora. You'll make everyone smile.

00:07:42.610 --> 00:07:46.600
Because you are Yusyo Sakaki's son.

00:07:49.410 --> 00:07:51.800
Sorry to ramble on like that.

00:07:51.800 --> 00:07:54.060
I end my turn now.

00:07:54.900 --> 00:07:58.500
In that instant, Smile World's effect ends,

00:07:58.500 --> 00:08:01.160
and the monsters' attack points return to normal.

00:08:01.520 --> 00:08:06.130
At the same time, Road Raven 
Red Queen's effect ends,

00:08:06.520 --> 00:08:11.100
and I lose control of Salutiger and Helpprincess.

00:08:11.400 --> 00:08:13.210
They return to your field.

00:08:14.040 --> 00:08:16.810
Their attack points return to normal, too.

00:08:19.780 --> 00:08:23.340
Well, can I ask you one more question?

00:08:23.340 --> 00:08:26.520
Now that you've mastered what lies beyond 
Pendulum and become stronger,

00:08:26.520 --> 00:08:27.990
what will you do next?

00:08:28.420 --> 00:08:30.960
I... I...

00:08:33.350 --> 00:08:35.880
I... I...

00:08:42.210 --> 00:08:43.200
My turn!

00:08:43.200 --> 00:08:44.360
Draw!

00:08:51.750 --> 00:08:54.810
Ladies and gentlemen!

00:08:55.190 --> 00:08:56.780
Yahoo!

00:08:56.780 --> 00:08:58.020
Yuya's fighting...

00:08:58.020 --> 00:08:59.250
...his entertainment duel!

00:08:59.250 --> 00:09:00.950
It gives me shivers!

00:09:00.950 --> 00:09:04.090
Hey, don't get the shivers just yet.

00:09:04.090 --> 00:09:05.450
The fun...

00:09:05.450 --> 00:09:07.000
...is only getting started!

00:09:09.600 --> 00:09:11.600
I can't wait!

00:09:11.850 --> 00:09:14.830
Sorry for the long wait, everyone!

00:09:15.150 --> 00:09:20.190
You're about to watch the entertainment 
duel, pioneered by Yusyo Sakaki,

00:09:20.190 --> 00:09:21.810
pride of the You Show School!

00:09:21.810 --> 00:09:23.540
There we go!

00:09:24.000 --> 00:09:28.460
I'll raise the curtain with the technique 
first discovered by me, Yuya Sakaki,

00:09:28.460 --> 00:09:30.010
Pendulum Summon!

00:09:30.750 --> 00:09:34.040
I set Scale 1 Stargazer Magician

00:09:34.040 --> 00:09:38.600
and Scale 8 Timegazer Magician 
on the Pendulum Scale.

00:09:45.490 --> 00:09:48.830
Now, I can summon monsters between 
Levels 2 and 7 simultaneously!

00:09:50.140 --> 00:09:52.770
Swing, my soul's pendulum.

00:09:53.080 --> 00:09:55.350
Draw an arc of light in the sky!

00:09:55.740 --> 00:09:57.310
Pendulum Summon!

00:09:57.310 --> 00:10:02.040
Come out, the heroic one with beautiful 
different-colored eyes,

00:10:02.040 --> 00:10:04.550
Odd-Eyes Pendulum Dragon!

00:10:06.150 --> 00:10:07.450
Wh-What's next?

00:10:07.450 --> 00:10:08.620
Pendulum Fusion?

00:10:08.620 --> 00:10:09.840
Pendulum Xyz?

00:10:09.840 --> 00:10:11.380
Hurry, hurry!

00:10:12.140 --> 00:10:13.820
I see, I see...

00:10:13.820 --> 00:10:19.120
Given past battles, it's only natural 
for you to expect those to be next.

00:10:19.120 --> 00:10:21.110
But in honor of the first meeting

00:10:21.110 --> 00:10:26.600
of my father, Yusyo Sakaki, and my opponent, 
former ladies gang boss Shooting Star Yoko,

00:10:26.920 --> 00:10:31.370
I thought I'd make a rainbow appear 
in the night sky, over this pier!

00:10:32.860 --> 00:10:36.470
I activate my spell card Magical Sky Mirror in my hand!

00:10:38.810 --> 00:10:41.690
This card lets me choose one card

00:10:41.690 --> 00:10:45.800
my opponent used last turn that's currently 
in the graveyard, and activate it!

00:10:47.160 --> 00:10:50.730
I activate Smile World in your graveyard!

00:10:58.140 --> 00:11:00.490
It gives me shivers!

00:11:00.870 --> 00:11:02.840
Darling!

00:11:03.400 --> 00:11:05.440
Smile World's effect

00:11:05.440 --> 00:11:08.730
increases the attack points 
of all monsters on the field

00:11:08.730 --> 00:11:13.060
by their total number multiplied by 100!

00:11:22.560 --> 00:11:23.460
They smiled!

00:11:23.460 --> 00:11:25.480
Odd-Eyes and Red Queen did, too.

00:11:25.480 --> 00:11:27.670
This is Smile World's effect!

00:11:27.670 --> 00:11:31.140
The smiles have everyone shivering up a storm!

00:11:31.480 --> 00:11:33.530
Now, it's time for the climax!

00:11:33.530 --> 00:11:35.870
Let's put on a showy finale!

00:11:37.370 --> 00:11:38.310
Battle!

00:11:38.710 --> 00:11:43.780
I attack Road Raven Red Queen with 
Odd-Eyes Pendulum Dragon!

00:11:44.320 --> 00:11:46.620
Spiral Strike Burst!

00:11:48.130 --> 00:11:49.660
Hey, there...

00:11:52.400 --> 00:11:57.080
When Odd-Eyes Pendulum Dragon battles 
a monster of Level 5 or above,

00:11:57.080 --> 00:11:58.960
its battle damage is doubled!

00:11:59.460 --> 00:12:00.770
Reaction Force!

00:12:04.190 --> 00:12:07.410
Now, I attack directly with Performapal Salutiger!

00:12:15.310 --> 00:12:16.010
Mom!

00:12:16.310 --> 00:12:18.090
I'm not "Mom"!

00:12:18.090 --> 00:12:20.780
Right now, I am Shooting Star Yoko.

00:12:20.780 --> 00:12:25.490
As the legendary boss of the ladies 
gang, I will take your final attack!

00:12:25.800 --> 00:12:27.900
Bring it on!

00:12:27.900 --> 00:12:30.680
Okay... Now for the finishing touch!

00:12:30.680 --> 00:12:31.390
Go!

00:12:31.390 --> 00:12:36.510
Performapal Helpprincess, attack gang 
boss Yoko directly!

00:12:59.430 --> 00:13:03.160
It's been a while since I fought one, 
but I really do love dueling.

00:13:03.830 --> 00:13:05.130
Mom!

00:13:07.460 --> 00:13:08.600
Shooting Star Yoko...

00:13:18.150 --> 00:13:20.230
Take it as a parting gift.

00:13:23.170 --> 00:13:25.220
Smile World...

00:13:25.550 --> 00:13:28.550
This is the card that linked you and Dad.

00:13:29.110 --> 00:13:34.530
He told me to give you this card 
when you really needed it.

00:13:36.220 --> 00:13:38.200
I think this is that time.

00:13:40.340 --> 00:13:41.450
Listen to me.

00:13:41.450 --> 00:13:44.340
No matter where you go, don't forget your smile.

00:13:44.340 --> 00:13:47.150
If you ever feel that happening, look at that card

00:13:47.150 --> 00:13:50.360
and remember your father and what took place today.

00:13:50.360 --> 00:13:51.310
Mom...

00:13:51.310 --> 00:13:53.600
Remember that you must see things through.

00:13:53.600 --> 00:13:57.940
You can save Yuzu. And stop the fighting, too.

00:13:58.820 --> 00:14:00.390
That's what I believe.

00:14:01.200 --> 00:14:03.450
I believe in you, too, Yuya!

00:14:03.760 --> 00:14:04.690
Same here!

00:14:04.690 --> 00:14:05.660
Me, too.

00:14:06.000 --> 00:14:07.390
I believe in you, too.

00:14:07.390 --> 00:14:09.800
Principal... Guys...

00:14:09.800 --> 00:14:12.070
Everyone's wishes can be granted.

00:14:13.180 --> 00:14:15.050
That is what my prophecies say.

00:14:15.050 --> 00:14:17.180
So you must believe in yourself...

00:14:17.180 --> 00:14:19.340
In the duelist named Yuya Sakaki.

00:14:19.960 --> 00:14:20.940
Mieru...

00:14:31.590 --> 00:14:32.920
I believe.

00:14:33.460 --> 00:14:36.960
I believe in the entertainment duels 
I inherited from my father!

00:14:36.960 --> 00:14:40.000
I'll use my duels to make everyone smile, 
stop the fighting,

00:14:40.000 --> 00:14:41.930
and bring Yuzu back.

00:14:42.310 --> 00:14:46.820
And I will return to the You Show 
School... To all of you!

00:15:00.460 --> 00:15:02.720
Gongenzaka, your face...

00:15:02.720 --> 00:15:05.660
I had a serious duel with my father.

00:15:05.660 --> 00:15:08.750
He wanted me to prove I'm ready.

00:15:11.720 --> 00:15:14.300
You're late, Yuya Sakaki!

00:15:14.300 --> 00:15:17.640
You need ten thousand years 
before you keep me waiting.

00:15:17.640 --> 00:15:21.200
That almost makes it sound like he's early...

00:15:21.200 --> 00:15:24.160
Quiet. Don't mock me!

00:15:24.160 --> 00:15:25.460
Is everyone here?

00:15:30.280 --> 00:15:32.940
The president emerges last, eh?

00:15:37.550 --> 00:15:41.740
All seven members of the Lancers 
are here, Captain!

00:15:41.740 --> 00:15:42.970
Not seven.

00:15:42.970 --> 00:15:45.120
Oh, I beg your pardon.

00:15:45.120 --> 00:15:46.620
It's eight, including you!

00:15:46.620 --> 00:15:47.830
Nine.

00:15:49.280 --> 00:15:50.780
We are taking Layra, too.

00:15:55.270 --> 00:15:57.270
We aren't going there to play.

00:15:57.530 --> 00:16:00.570
You think we can fight Academia 
with that child along?

00:16:00.840 --> 00:16:02.080
He'll hold us back!

00:16:02.080 --> 00:16:04.760
Layra's abilities are on par with yours.

00:16:04.760 --> 00:16:06.590
He won't hold us back at all.

00:16:06.590 --> 00:16:08.430
On par with ours?

00:16:09.190 --> 00:16:12.280
If he has the captain's faith, he must be impressive.

00:16:12.280 --> 00:16:13.390
How old are you?

00:16:13.390 --> 00:16:15.290
He's obviously in elementary school.

00:16:15.670 --> 00:16:19.610
It's impossible to believe that a 
Junior Class member's ability

00:16:19.610 --> 00:16:23.920
is on par with that of the masters of the 
Pendulum, the Sawatari Generation.

00:16:23.920 --> 00:16:25.730
Sawatari Generation? Give me a break!

00:16:26.070 --> 00:16:28.700
Yuya's the one who first performed Pendulum.

00:16:28.700 --> 00:16:30.940
Don't pretend like you discovered it yourself.

00:16:31.200 --> 00:16:32.700
Regardless, I do not accept it!

00:16:32.700 --> 00:16:35.910
We cannot make it to Academia with him.

00:16:36.420 --> 00:16:38.380
We aren't going to Academia.

00:16:38.380 --> 00:16:39.610
What?

00:16:41.590 --> 00:16:43.930
We're heading for the Synchro Dimension.

00:16:43.930 --> 00:16:46.480
The Synchro Dimension? Not Fusion?

00:16:46.480 --> 00:16:47.350
Why?

00:16:47.350 --> 00:16:51.850
So far, the Synchro Dimension is unaffected 
by the interdimensional war.

00:16:51.850 --> 00:16:53.320
We can gain allies there.

00:16:53.860 --> 00:16:56.720
Our first goal should be to build bonds

00:16:56.720 --> 00:17:01.730
between our dimensions, and forge an alliance 
that will oppose the Fusion Dimension.

00:17:02.060 --> 00:17:03.470
An alliance?

00:17:03.960 --> 00:17:06.700
We don't have time for that!

00:17:06.700 --> 00:17:09.610
We need to get to the Fusion Dimension 
as soon as possible,

00:17:09.610 --> 00:17:11.480
to crush Academia.

00:17:11.520 --> 00:17:13.340
I thought that's what the Lancers were for!

00:17:13.340 --> 00:17:15.800
I do not fight battles I cannot win.

00:17:15.800 --> 00:17:16.450
What?

00:17:16.770 --> 00:17:20.260
To win, we will require significant preparation.

00:17:20.790 --> 00:17:24.140
If we challenge Academia at our current level,

00:17:24.140 --> 00:17:26.160
we stand no chance of victory.

00:17:26.160 --> 00:17:29.160
Joining forces with you was a mistake.

00:17:29.160 --> 00:17:32.860
I'll get to Academia and save Ruri myself.

00:17:33.590 --> 00:17:35.100
You cannot do it alone.

00:17:36.100 --> 00:17:40.030
Academia brings together duelists from 
all over the Fusion Dimension,

00:17:40.030 --> 00:17:41.850
gives them elite training,

00:17:41.850 --> 00:17:45.730
and produces powerful duel warriors 
who can withstand real combat.

00:17:45.730 --> 00:17:48.710
What can going there alone accomplish?

00:17:49.170 --> 00:17:51.590
I agree with Reiji's plan.

00:17:52.160 --> 00:17:56.450
This is the time for us to build our forces, 
to prepare for a real victory.

00:17:56.950 --> 00:18:00.580
Don't worry. The Professor won't hurt Ruri.

00:18:01.910 --> 00:18:04.700
If you'd seen how the Professor 
treated me, you'd know.

00:18:05.200 --> 00:18:07.400
Ruri and I look alike, right?

00:18:07.700 --> 00:18:09.070
So does Yuzu.

00:18:10.140 --> 00:18:14.460
For some reason, the Professor 
is gathering people like me.

00:18:15.190 --> 00:18:17.480
The reason Academia kidnapped Ruri...

00:18:17.480 --> 00:18:21.570
The reason they want to bring me 
back is due to his orders...

00:18:21.570 --> 00:18:23.350
I'm sure it's the same for Yuzu.

00:18:25.920 --> 00:18:30.050
I don't know what he's gathering us for.

00:18:30.320 --> 00:18:34.020
But we appear to be very important to him.

00:18:34.680 --> 00:18:38.380
So I'm sure he will keep Ruri very safe.

00:18:40.500 --> 00:18:43.340
Yuzu... Is he doing anything to Yuzu?

00:18:43.340 --> 00:18:45.670
Yuzu is not at Academia.

00:18:47.020 --> 00:18:48.570
Isn't that right, Reiji?

00:18:49.890 --> 00:18:51.760
He said he saw it.

00:18:51.760 --> 00:18:54.610
He saw Yuzu disappear with a duelist 
from the Synchro Dimension.

00:18:56.480 --> 00:19:00.080
Synchro? Wasn't Yuzu taken by Joeri?

00:19:00.630 --> 00:19:03.820
Is that true? Is Yuzu really in 
the Synchro Dimension?!

00:19:04.210 --> 00:19:05.240
She is.

00:19:05.800 --> 00:19:08.590
Yuzu disappeared with a duelist 
from the Synchro Dimension.

00:19:09.730 --> 00:19:11.130
And then, that duelist

00:19:11.450 --> 00:19:15.570
annihilated the duel warriors from Academia 
called the "Obelisk Force."

00:19:15.570 --> 00:19:18.160
That is when I realized it...

00:19:18.160 --> 00:19:20.800
That we could ally with the Synchro Dimension.

00:19:21.170 --> 00:19:24.450
Yuzu is in the Synchro Dimension. I'm certain of it.

00:19:24.450 --> 00:19:28.150
I owe Yuzu. I won't let Academia have her!

00:19:30.430 --> 00:19:32.750
To save Ruri, too,

00:19:32.750 --> 00:19:35.180
we need an alliance with the Synchro Dimension!

00:19:36.390 --> 00:19:37.750
I don't like it, but...

00:19:47.720 --> 00:19:50.400
These are duel disks mounted with

00:19:50.400 --> 00:19:53.420
a dimensional-travel device that we just developed.

00:19:53.420 --> 00:19:55.970
We based it on that from the Xyz Dimension.

00:19:56.320 --> 00:19:58.970
From the Xyz Dimension? You mean Ute's disk?

00:19:58.970 --> 00:20:00.160
Damn you.

00:20:00.160 --> 00:20:02.790
You said Ute left a card with you, didn't you?

00:20:02.790 --> 00:20:05.450
Did you take his duel disk by force, too?

00:20:07.400 --> 00:20:08.920
Say something!

00:20:08.920 --> 00:20:10.010
Trust him.

00:20:11.570 --> 00:20:13.780
Yuya is my comrade. I trust him.

00:20:14.320 --> 00:20:17.390
He would never betray us.

00:20:17.880 --> 00:20:18.740
Ute...

00:20:22.240 --> 00:20:23.430
What's wrong?

00:20:25.000 --> 00:20:25.860
Nothing.

00:20:26.610 --> 00:20:28.190
Allow me to continue.

00:20:29.120 --> 00:20:34.580
These disks also have a built-in 
function to create Action Fields.

00:20:34.580 --> 00:20:38.390
Kurosaki and Serena's disks were 
given the same treatment.

00:20:38.950 --> 00:20:43.500
Pendulum Summon and the Action Cards 
are our greatest weapons.

00:20:43.500 --> 00:20:45.820
I've designed these to make maximum use of them.

00:20:46.600 --> 00:20:49.630
Now, prepare the cards I handed out.

00:20:51.670 --> 00:20:55.000
We've input them with the Synchro 
Dimension's coordinate data.

00:20:55.000 --> 00:20:56.760
Set them into your disks,

00:20:56.760 --> 00:20:58.700
then activate them on my signal.

00:21:09.610 --> 00:21:13.160
I guess they're already gone. 
Yuya and the others...

00:21:13.160 --> 00:21:15.890
I wish we could have seen them off.

00:21:15.890 --> 00:21:19.130
But I'm sure they know how we feel.

00:21:19.130 --> 00:21:22.300
I hope they do. And how I feel, too.

00:21:22.300 --> 00:21:23.860
Nico Smiley...

00:21:24.230 --> 00:21:26.880
Yuya was my dream.

00:21:26.880 --> 00:21:29.690
I wanted to see him become a first-rate duelist

00:21:29.690 --> 00:21:32.640
and stand atop the world...

00:21:32.950 --> 00:21:37.610
But I also believe that he will return to us.

00:21:37.610 --> 00:21:40.110
He will. He promised.

00:21:40.420 --> 00:21:43.200
Yuya would never break his promise.

00:21:43.200 --> 00:21:46.080
And he'll give us all the shivers again!

00:21:46.080 --> 00:21:48.010
Yeah, that's right.

00:21:48.010 --> 00:21:50.240
And till then, we'll work our hardest!

00:21:50.240 --> 00:21:51.820
Yuya, you work hard, too!

00:21:51.820 --> 00:21:54.290
Burn! Let your blood boil!

00:21:54.540 --> 00:21:57.260
Now, let's move out to the Synchro Dimension.

00:21:57.780 --> 00:21:59.750
Dimensionizer, activate!

00:23:46.900 --> 00:23:50.710
I was attacked by Academia duelists.

00:23:51.800 --> 00:23:52.980
What about the battle royal?

00:23:53.460 --> 00:23:56.010
Huh? Are you still half-asleep or something?

00:23:56.010 --> 00:23:57.710
He looks just like Yuya.

00:23:58.080 --> 00:23:59.500
Are you...

00:23:59.500 --> 00:24:01.080
Yeah, I'm Hugo.

00:24:01.540 --> 00:24:05.530
And this is the town I was born in, City.

00:24:05.920 --> 00:24:08.560
I've been sent to another dimension?

00:24:09.060 --> 00:24:13.400
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ARC-V: 
The Synchro Dimension. "City."

00:24:13.400 --> 00:24:15.380
The fun is only getting started!
